{"title":"IMO problems statistics","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This page lists the number of IMO problems per proposing country for the years 1959-2021.\n</p>\n<table style=\"text-align:right\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>#problems</th>\n<th>: proposed by country\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>28</td>\n<td>Poland\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>Netherlands\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>23</td>\n<td>United Kingdom\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>Romania\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>*USSR\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>Bulgaria\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>Russia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>*Czechoslovakia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>Hungary\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>USA\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>*West Germany\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9.5</td>\n<td>Australia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>*East Germany\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>France\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>South Korea\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Finland\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Iran\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Sweden\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>India\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Luxembourg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Austria\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Belarus\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Belgium\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Czech Republic\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Ukraine\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Canada\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Greece\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Ireland\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Mongolia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Serbia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>*Yugoslavia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>China\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Estonia\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Japan\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>New Zealand\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>South Africa\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Vietna